Z||000014||sqoach||09-07-2001||06:50 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fiero*101:<BR><B>Hey sqoach how long have you had your 86 SE?<BR>and what problems have you had w/ it?<P>Ive had my Car since early June,And i bought it nowing that there were some problems but more and more things go wrong w/ it and im not sure what to do about alot of my problems<P>Fiero*101</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I've had it for about 2 months now. Haven't really had any problems. It needs brake work, but all cars do some time. It's been a good car since I've had it. My previous daily driver (86 SC) I had quite a few problems. But it has 128K miles, so some things are expected. This one has 82K miles. How many miles on yours? You might check your converter to see if it's clogging and making that popping noise. Can you tell where it's coming from? It just happens when you accelerate?||||reg||1
