Z||000017||Raydar||09-07-2001||06:59 PM||||You didn't say what kind of pop it makes.<BR>Does it sound like a backfire? <BR>Does the engine seem to misfire and hesitate when it happens?<BR>I've seen a coil that was about to die cause the same symptoms.<BR>Bad rods and such will cause steady knocking sounds, that get faster with engine speed. Not popping sounds.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
